msgctxt "185\t277"
msgid "What's up with those clothes, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "286\t409"
msgid ""
"I'm actually heading up to Tokyo.\\n"
"For about a week."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "410\t464"
msgid "Whoa, really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "465\t539"
msgid ""
"That's awesome!\\n"
"I'm coming, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540\t650"
msgid "Yeah! Take us with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704\t830"
msgid ""
"Sorry, kids.\\n"
"It's not gonna be a vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "837\t968"
msgid ""
"Your Uncle Kaz has some very\\n"
"important business to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "982\t1171"
msgid ""
"But while I'm gone, a new friend\\n"
"is gonna come live here with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1478\t1538"
msgid "This is Saki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1539\t1650"
msgid ""
"She's been through a lot,\\n"
"so she has some trouble talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1703\t1861"
msgid ""
"Her dad's hurt, too.\\n"
"He's in the hospital right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1862\t1986"
msgid ""
"For the time being,\\n"
"I told her she can stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2014\t2155"
msgid ""
"So what do you say?\\n"
"Can you make her feel at home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2282\t2345"
msgid "Darn right we can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2427\t2497"
msgid "Come on, Saki-chan!"
msgstr ""